# The dev build never COPYs repo files: .devcontainer/Dockerfile installs
# only remote URLs (apt, cpanm, opencode). Keep the transfer to the daemon
# at KB by excluding everything except the Dockerfile itself.
# Invariant: if the Dockerfile ever COPYs from the repo, allowlist those
# paths here with `!` exceptions.
*
!.devcontainer/
# Generated local-only TLS material must never reach the daemon at all,
# and skipping it keeps the transfer minimal.
.devcontainer/odkc/certs
